msgid "常见操作的梯度"
msgstr "Gradients of Common Operations"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:272
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{ref}`back-propagation`的实现依赖于定义每个基本操作的梯度规则。下面是神经网络中常用操作的梯度："
msgstr "The implementation of {ref}`back-propagation` relies on defining gradient rules for each basic operation. Below are the gradients for operations commonly used in neural networks:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "操作"
msgstr "Operation"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "前向"
msgstr "Forward"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "反向梯度"
msgstr "Backward Gradient"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "加法 $z = x + y$"
msgstr "Addition $z = x + y$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "$z = x + y$"
msgstr "$z = x + y$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z}$, "
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial y} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z}$"
msgstr ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z}$, "
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial y} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z}$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "乘法 $z = x \\times y$"
msgstr "Multiplication $z = x \\times y$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "$z = x \\times y$"
msgstr "$z = x \\times y$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z} "
"\\cdot y$, $\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial y} = \\frac{\\partial "
"L}{\\partial z} \\cdot x$"
msgstr ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z} "
"\\cdot y$, $\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial y} = \\frac{\\partial "
"L}{\\partial z} \\cdot x$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "ReLU $z = \\max(0, x)$"
msgstr "ReLU $z = \\max(0, x)$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "$z = \\max(0, x)$"
msgstr "$z = \\max(0, x)$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z}$ (if"
" $x>0$), else 0"
msgstr ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z}$ (if"
" $x>0$), else 0"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "Sigmoid $z = \\sigma(x)$"
msgstr "Sigmoid $z = \\sigma(x)$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
msgid "$z = \\sigma(x)$"
msgstr "$z = \\sigma(x)$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:230
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z} "
"\\cdot z(1-z)$"
msgstr ""
"$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z} "
"\\cdot z(1-z)$"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:281
#, python-brace-format
msgid "更多激活函数的梯度定义，参见 {doc}`activation-functions`。"
msgstr "For gradient definitions of more activation functions, see {doc}`activation-functions`."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:283
msgid "反向传播的优势"
msgstr "Advantages of Backpropagation"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:285
msgid "{{ bp_computational_efficiency }}"
msgstr "{{ bp_computational_efficiency }}"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:287
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`back-propagation`的时间复杂度是 $O(n)$，其中 $n$ 是{ref}`computational-"
"graph`中边的数量。相比之下，数值差分需要 $O(n \\times p)$，其中 $p$ 是参数数量。"
msgstr ""
"The time complexity of {ref}`back-propagation` is $O(n)$, where $n$ is the "
"number of edges in the {ref}`computational-graph`. In contrast, numerical differentiation "
"requires $O(n \\times p)$, where $p$ is the number of parameters."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/back-propagation.md:289
msgid "**关键**：通过复用中间计算结果，避免重复求导。"
msgstr "**Key**: By reusing intermediate computation results, redundant differentiation is avoided."

